Derived work
------------

Portions of this software derive from Spytify (https://github.com/jwallet/spy-spotify),
Copyright (c) 2018 Spytify by jwallet, distributed under the MIT License. Its copyright
notice is carried in LICENSE alongside Offstream's, as that licence requires.

What derives from it is behaviour, not naming: Spotify title parsing, ad and idle-state
detection, audio buffering and silence-trim semantics, filename templating, and path
assembly were ported and re-namespaced. No inherited identifier appears in this
repository, and a test fails the build if one reappears.


